  "reason": "Terminal notification presentation is explicit and independent of automatic launch; inherit preserves host gates, and an exact malformed resolution cannot manufacture completion. Editor Save explicitly activates the existing goal; an armed badge updates its label and accessible name when the language changes. Feedback drafts and their open review survive artifact handoff without changing exact authored text. Structured questions reuse the established answer card and automatic navigation. Saved answers retain the original tool position and decode supported result envelopes without inventing request identities or expiry.",
